📑 Business Summary:
This project is a Power BI dashboard created to analyze machine business performance across sales, profit, supply chain and operations. It enables zone-wise and product-wise insights to support business decisions like identifying top revenue zones, profitability drivers, supply-demand gaps and machine maintenance impact.

🎯 Objectives & Focus:
Monitor overall Revenue, Price, Profit and machine performances.
Compare performance by Zone Name(South/North/East/West) and Zone Type(Urban/Rural).
Track product Supplied vs Sold to identify distribution gaps.
Evaluate Machine Usage Hours and Maintenance Cost for operational efficiency.

🌍 Analysis Coverage:
Zone-wise | Product-wise | Category-wise.

📈 Performance Indicators:
Total Revenue.
Total Price.
Total Profit.
Average Profit.
Quantity Supplied.
Quantity Sold.
Machine Usage(HRS).
Maintenance Cost.

🗂️ Report Structure:
Sales & Revenue Performance – Revenue and price split by zone wise & product wise.
Profit Analysis – Total and average profit view by zone wise and product wise.
Supply & Distribution – product Supplied vs sold quantity comparison.
Machine Performance & Usage – Machine hours and Maintenance cost evaluation.

🏆 Results & Value:
Identified top-performing zones/products to support targeting decisions.
Analyzed supply vs sales gaps to improve distribution efficiency.
Tracked maintenance vs usage patterns to support service planning.

🎛️ Control Panel:
Slicers used: Product ID, Sale ID, Category ID and Supplier ID.

🛠 Technology Used:
Python (dataset preparation) | Excel | Basic DAX | Data Modeling | Power BI.
